      "value": "In the developer update threads I saw some user post about running the iOS version on a Mac, I don't think they posted this thread, but go back one or two and their comment should be there, search for TestFlight.\n\nIf they added a separate version for macos content, they'd kinda be asking content creators to upload 4 different versions, and two of those being apple platforms.",
